  "title": "Skyward Specialty Promotes John Burkhart to President, U.S. Property & Casualty - Skyward Specialty Insurance",
  "summary": "Skyward Specialty Insurance Group announced the promotion of John Burkhart to President, U.S. Property & Casualty. In this expanded role, Burkhart will oversee the Company’s Captives & Specialty Programs divisions, in addition to his current leadership of Professional Lines, Industry Solutions, Surety, Accident & Health, and Transactional E&S. Claims, Technology Solution Services, and Pricing Actuarial will also report to him, further strengthening operational alignment to support Skyward Specialty’s continued growth and strategic execution.",
